# Collected measurement data.
# The collector writes sweeps into data/ as it runs; captures belong with the
# experiment that produced them, not in the tool repo. A single 2.5 h run is
# ~440 MB, well past GitHub's file limit.
data/
*.csv
*.log
*.npz

